/Further modify your program by adding jump 
/instructions to repeat the data input, 
/modify and display activities endlessly.
/Using “skipcond” instruction, 
/exit the program when the user inputs data ‘0’.
/接收输入 -> 存入变量 -> 加 1 -> 输出

Check,  Input
        SkipCond 400    /如果输入为0，就跳过下面的jume loop,直接end
        Jump Loop
        Jump End

Loop,   Store numIn
        Add One
        Output
        Jump Check

End,    Halt

numIn,      DEC 0
One,        DEC 1